@ollama = http://localhost:11434
@repowise = http://localhost:7337
@model = gemma4:26b-mxfp8-ctx256k

### Installed Ollama models
GET {{ollama}}/api/tags
Accept: application/json

### Models currently loaded by Ollama
GET {{ollama}}/api/ps
Accept: application/json

### Minimal native Ollama chat probe with the bakeoff sampling values
POST {{ollama}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Reply with exactly: ready"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false,
  "think": false,
  "options": {
    "temperature": 0.3,
    "top_p": 0.95,
    "top_k": 64
  }
}

### Repowise API schema
GET {{repowise}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json
